        "created_at": "2026-08-05T08:53:12.349Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Virtual machines are detected unless you pass through your actual CPU and GPU. If you want to run multiple Roblox clients without being scared of deleting mutex &amp; event handlers you can set up multiple RDP sessions to run a Roblox client on each one.</p>",
